Sylvester has an active **paid Apple Developer Program** membership (discovered 2026-07-04 during fitxapp sideloading):

- Apple ID: pelotonysl@outlook.com (⚠️ different from Google account)
- Team ID: **QGMAWHX827**, enrolled as Individual
- Renews 2026-02-19 → 2027-02-19, $99/yr auto-renew
- Program License Agreement accepted 2026-04-12

Implications for ALL iOS projects ([[project-feargod-twi-bible]], MedChat/pc-ios, fitxapp, foodtrack):
- TestFlight distribution is available (phone + watch OTA installs, 90-day builds)
- Signed sideloads last 1 year, not 7 days
- CI→TestFlight pipelines possible via App Store Connect API key (as of 2026-07-04 no API key created yet)
- Local Mac has NO Xcode (CLT only, ~1GB free disk) — cloud/CI builds are the only path
