- Taskboard task: `ms38ag7aizge` "MONEY ENGINE — active revenue push" — the queue lives there; update it every session that touches a money project.
- Daily 9:00 nudge: launchd `com.sly.money-engine` (~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.sly.money-engine.plist), same pattern as the Friday linkedin-legends ping.
