- **2026-08-07 sprint: `~/gumroad-products/` = the staging area.** 5 products fully built (zip + LISTING.md paste copy each), awaiting ONE manual Gumroad session: slyci playbook $19 (`/l/slyci` — slyci README already links it), login-light $10 + login-dark $12 (`/l/login-light`, `/l/login-dark` — both theme READMEs link them), autoapply playbook $29 (`/l/autoapply`, sanitized, launch posts drafted), mcp-pack $39 (`/l/mcp-pack`, 9 sanitized servers, syntax-verified). Plus opengym3d-launch/LAUNCH-KIT.md (itch.io mirror + Reddit/X posts). Permalinks are LOAD-BEARING — pushed README links assume them. Any $10 sale unlocks Gumroad Discover storewide.

