name: project_lastlegjet_marketplace
description: Last Leg Jet Marketplace — full web marketplace (FRD, Oceania MVP Dec 2026), stack confirmed 2026-08-21; distinct from ~/lastleg empty-legs iOS app
metadata:
  type: project
---

Last Leg Jet **Marketplace** = a separate, larger project from the ~/lastleg repo (that one is the empty-legs scraper + iOS app on TestFlight, ASC 6795185678).

- FRD-driven: Customer Marketplace + Operator Portal + Admin Portal, Oceania pilot, MVP target **December 2026**.
- Stack confirmed 2026-08-21 (modular monolith): Next.js/React/TS + Tailwind/shadcn, NestJS, PostgreSQL + Prisma, Redis + BullMQ, Auth0-or-Cognito, Stripe Connect, AWS (RDS/ElastiCache/S3/SES/CloudFront/WAF), GitHub Actions, Sentry + CloudWatch, Jest/Supertest/Playwright, GA4 + PostHog.
- Design mockups (public Drive folder 11A_l0AgQ0ocuQgRfrb9SP-zxphk3aXgy, 9 PNGs, NO FRD doc there) show things the stack must cover: 4 payment methods (Card / PayPal / Klarna / Crypto BTC-ETH-USDC-USDT w/ QR + 15-min rate lock), "Ask AI Assistant" on flight detail, route map, List+Calendar search views. Mockup copy still says "AeroLeg" and "Part 135" (US) — Oceania needs CASA/CAA wording.
- **BUILT 2026-08-21**: repo ~/lastlegjet-marketplace → AssiamahS/lastlegjet-marketplace (PRIVATE). apps/api NestJS 11 :4000 (+/docs swagger), apps/web Next 15 :3001. npm only (corepack pnpm broken). Local services = `brew services start postgresql@15 redis`, db `lastlegjet`. Seed logins all `Password123!`: customer@lastlegjet.dev, operator@skyline.dev, operator@pacific.dev (PENDING), admin@lastlegjet.dev, compliance@lastlegjet.dev. Payments in MOCK mode until STRIPE keys set. Tracked gaps: docs/MVP_CHECKLIST.md (85 done / 13 post-MVP).
- **Phase 2 (2026-08-21)**: PUBLIC API https://lastlegjet-api.sylvesterassiamahpm.workers.dev/v1 = Cloudflare Worker relay (infra/relay, KV 9dd9412a1d0e4a028d8c56a94236404b key `upstream`) → cloudflared quick tunnel → Mac :4000; launchd com.lastlegjet.api + com.lastlegjet.tunnel (scripts/tunnel.sh). This network can't resolve trycloudflare.com (only the CF edge can) — always test via the relay. Dummy providers: /meta sampleData, /aviation/* (AVIATIONSTACK_KEY optional), /operator/payouts(+connect mock acct), POST /admin/bookings/:id/refund.
- **PUBLIC WEB URL (2026-08-25)**: https://lastlegjet-web.sylvesterassiamahpm.workers.dev = same relay worker deployed as `wrangler deploy --env web` (KV key `upstream-web`) → cloudflared tunnel → `next start -p 3001` (PROD BUILD, not dev). launchd: com.lastlegjet.web + com.lastlegjet.web-tunnel (tunnel.sh env PORT/KV_KEY/RELAY/PROBE_PATH). After web code changes: `npm run build:web` then `launchctl kickstart -k gui/$UID/com.lastlegjet.web`. Relay rewrites Location headers (Next redirects). Tailscale is NOT installed on this Mac anymore (LAN 10.0.0.58) — public links must go via Cloudflare relays.
- **iOS app = ~/lastleg repo (AssiamahS/lastlegjet, ASC 6795185678, com.assiamah.lastleg)** rebuilt 2026-08-21 as the marketplace customer client v2.0.0 (iOS 26, default base URL = relay, bundled sample data in ios/Resources/SampleData, "Sample data" banner). CI→TestFlight on push; repo has a scheduled `refresh legs` job that pushes commits → `git pull --rebase` before every push.
- Trap: Next server layout → client component props must be plain data (icons by name). `prisma migrate reset` blocked under Claude Code → DROP SCHEMA recipe in NOTES.md.
- Architecture diagram PNG: ~/Downloads/Technology Archetecture Image Aug 19, 2026, 03_45_08 PM.png

**How to apply:** on any "Last Leg Jet" marketplace/FRD/architecture mention, this is the web platform, not the iOS app. gdrive MCP token was invalid_grant on 2026-08-21 — re-auth before trying to read the FRD from Drive.
